---
subject: "Aviso Importante: Sua conta foi temporariamente suspensa"
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge" />
  <title>Conta Suspensa</title>
  <style>
    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap');
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif; background-color: #0f1117; margin: 0; padding: 0; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
    .email-wrapper { background-color: #0f1117; padding: 40px 20px; min-height: 100vh; }
    .email-container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 25px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); }
    .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1c0a0a 0%, #2d1010 50%, #3d1515 100%); padding: 48px 40px 40px; text-align: center; position: relative; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.2); }
    .header::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 3px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #dc2626, #ef4444, #f87171, #ef4444, #dc2626); }
    .brand-name { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #f87171; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .header-title { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; color: #f1f5f9; line-height: 1.3; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .header-subtitle { font-size: 15px; color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 400; }
    .body { background-color: #12161f; padding: 40px; }
    .greeting { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: #e2e8f0; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .greeting span { color: #f87171; }
    .intro-text { font-size: 15px; color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 32px; }
    .info-box { background: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.15); border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px 20px; margin-bottom: 32px; }
    .info-box-label { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #dc2626; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .info-box-text { font-size: 13px; color: #64748b; line-height: 1.6; }
    .consequences-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
    .consequences-list li { font-size: 14px; color: #94a3b8; padding: 6px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04); }
    .consequences-list li::before { content: '✗ '; color: #ef4444; font-weight: 700; }
    .help-box { background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15); border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px 20px; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 32px; }
    .help-box-label { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #3b82f6; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .help-box-text { font-size: 13px; color: #64748b; line-height: 1.6; }
    .footer { background-color: #0d1117; padding: 28px 40px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); }
    .footer-brand { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 8px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .footer-text { font-size: 12px; color: #334155; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="email-wrapper">
    <div class="email-container">
      <div class="header">
        <p class="brand-name">Sistema de Cooperativas</p>
        <h1 class="header-title">Conta Suspensa</h1>
        <p class="header-subtitle">Acesso temporariamente restrito.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="body">
        <p class="greeting">Olá, <span>{{memberName}}</span>.</p>
        <p class="intro-text">
          Informamos que sua conta foi suspensa em {{suspensionDate}}. Você atingiu <strong>{{penaltyCount}}</strong> penalidade(s) por: <strong>{{reason}}</strong>.
        </p>
        <div class="info-box">
          <p class="info-box-label">🚫 Consequências da Suspensão</p>
          <p class="info-box-text">
            <ul class="consequences-list">
              <li>Compras na cooperativa <strong>bloqueadas</strong>.</li>
              <li>Novos agendamentos em turnos <strong>bloqueados</strong>.</li>
            </ul>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="help-box">
          <p class="help-box-label">💬 Como Reverter</p>
          <p class="help-box-text">
            Para reverter a suspensão, entre em contato com a administração da cooperativa.
          </p>
        </div>
        <p class="intro-text">
          Sabemos que imprevistos acontecem. Nossa equipe está disponível para ajudar.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        <p class="footer-brand">Sistema de Cooperativas</p>
        <p class="footer-text">Este é um e-mail automático — por favor, não responda diretamente.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>